        - followUpType: 0
          speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 359f5f6b302fa244c8f52d53c2279cfe, type: 2}
          text: You leave the plaza together, already making plans to meet again. The new friendship feels exciting, though you can't help thinking about Eleanor.
